    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Barbarian</strong></i> is a multiplayer open-world survival-craft game developed solo by <strong>CraftingBenchGames.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather, craft, build, and upgrade as you explore the untamed lands of <strong>Barbaria</strong>. Face off against intense boss battles with a uniquely fluid combat system built around parries and dodges. Play solo, with friends, or jump into public multiplayer lobbies\u2014your character progression and gear persist across every world. Survive, thrive, and conquer the wilds of <strong>Barbaria!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/cf883b1a469ed4ccb49642325df0cecf.poster.avif?t=1754758481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/cf883b1a469ed4ccb49642325df0cecf.webm?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/cf883b1a469ed4ccb49642325df0cecf.mp4?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host your own world or join public lobbies with other players. Drop in, team up, and take down bosses together\u2014your character, loot, and progression travel with you wherever you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/f2fc86ca472463b37f75dfaf2639c32e.poster.avif?t=1754758481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/f2fc86ca472463b37f75dfaf2639c32e.webm?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/f2fc86ca472463b37f75dfaf2639c32e.mp4?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master <strong><i>Barbarian\u2019s</i></strong> fluid, skill-driven combat. Control each arm independently to parry, block, or strike while dodging in real time\u2014no animation locks. Chain moves dynamically to outwit enemies in intense, skill-driven battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/3cd81b97afd79fcfcbbd5c99feddf6bc.poster.avif?t=1754758481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/3cd81b97afd79fcfcbbd5c99feddf6bc.webm?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/3cd81b97afd79fcfcbbd5c99feddf6bc.mp4?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/a4bc45c411069d28490f21b8d1127d5c.poster.avif?t=1754758481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/a4bc45c411069d28490f21b8d1127d5c.webm?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/a4bc45c411069d28490f21b8d1127d5c.mp4?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting &amp; Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting is essential to survival in <strong>Barbarian</strong>. Rocks are a core resource\u2014you refine them into iron, coal, gold, or diamond, with gold and diamond being rare finds. Iron, coal, and gold can be smelted into bars, while diamonds are kept in raw form. These materials are used to craft weapons and armor, and are also consumed at the anvil to upgrade your gear. As you progress\u2014and with enough investment\u2014you can build automation machines to scale your production, which is crucial for crafting elite gear that demands massive amounts of refined materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/2badf2b4fcff803d0edbe50f3ec537bb.poster.avif?t=1754758481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/2badf2b4fcff803d0edbe50f3ec537bb.webm?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/2badf2b4fcff803d0edbe50f3ec537bb.mp4?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Build your own space in <strong>Barbaria</strong>. Gather resources to create homes or storage for your loot, designed exactly how you want. Enjoy total freedom to craft anything from simple shelters to wild, creative structures\u2014whether for fun or practicality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/baf437ce0c1d995b188815e2661e5ae8.poster.avif?t=1754758481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/baf437ce0c1d995b188815e2661e5ae8.webm?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/baf437ce0c1d995b188815e2661e5ae8.mp4?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Barbarian</i></strong> is in early development, and your support means everything. Add it to your Steam Wishlist\u2014it\u2019s totally free and helps support the journey as the game evolves! \ud83d\ude01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/d3116958142692ec9a3d10a9bcd534dc.poster.avif?t=1754758481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/d3116958142692ec9a3d10a9bcd534dc.webm?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475300/extras/d3116958142692ec9a3d10a9bcd534dc.mp4?t=1754758481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
